{
  "_about": "Study time from the local review log: Today, This week, This month, Total and the average per study day. A review counts when ease > 0 and type < 4 (learning, review, relearning, filtered); manual (4) and rescheduled (5) entries and unanswered rows do not. Its study day is study_day(id, offset_west_min, rollover_hour) from clients.json, with the clock at now_ms; reviews on a later study day than now's are left out. today is now's study day as a date; the week starts on Monday; the month is today's calendar month; total is every study day up to today. study_days counts days with at least one counted review, also when its time is 0; average_ms is total_ms / study_days rounded down, 0 without study days. durations: clients show floor(ms / 60000) minutes, as minutes alone under an hour and as hours and minutes from 60 minutes on. The desktop add-on (addon/study_time.py) and the Android app (AnkiquestStudyTime.kt) test their copies against these cases.",
